{"post_id":24,"title":"Shipping & Delivery","slug":"shipping-delivery","status":"publish","elementor_data":[{"id":"9e6b403","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"88","right":"64","bottom":"40","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":20,"column":"20","row":"20","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"567cee1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>POLICY</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":13},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":0.18}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"55b1aa7","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Shipping &amp; delivery","header_size":"h1","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":52},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.035},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.08}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"70d2dc1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Last updated [DATE]</p>","text_color":"#8E8E93","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"dc138a4","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"64","bottom":"88","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"c35a239","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Where we ship","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"49f126a","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We ship across India. We do not currently ship outside India. If your PIN code is not serviceable by our courier partners you will see a message at checkout before you pay.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"be01759","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Dispatch and delivery times","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"b860eca","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Orders placed before [4 PM] on a working day are dispatched the same day. Orders after that, or on a Sunday or public holiday, go out the next working day.</p><p>Once dispatched, delivery usually takes [2 to 4] working days to metro cities and [4 to 7] working days elsewhere. These are the courier's estimates, not guarantees, and they stretch during festival periods and in bad weather.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ec2aa3f","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Shipping charges","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"e47ddc8","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Shipping is [₹YOUR FLAT RATE] on orders below [₹YOUR THRESHOLD], and free above it. Cash on delivery carries an additional handling fee of [₹YOUR COD FEE], shown at checkout before you confirm.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"aeb85bd","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Tracking your order","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"758aa7a","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>You will get a tracking link by email and SMS when your parcel is handed to the courier. If the tracking has not moved for three working days, write to us at <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a> and we will chase it.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"2ec7b70","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"If nobody is home","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"7e33b55","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Couriers attempt delivery up to three times. After the third failed attempt the parcel returns to us. For prepaid orders we refund the order value minus the shipping actually incurred. For cash on delivery orders nothing was paid, so nothing is refunded, but repeated refusals may mean we ask for prepayment on future orders.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"44471da","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Damaged in transit","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"bd61370","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>If a parcel arrives visibly damaged, photograph it before opening and send the photographs to <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a> within 48 hours. We will replace the piece or refund it in full. You do not need to argue with us about this.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]}
